<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S1.p2.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>,
<a href="#S7.p3.1" title="7 Related Works ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§7</span></a>.
</span></li>
