<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">I. Zisman, A. Nikulin, V. Sinii, D. Tarasov, N. Lyubaykin, A. Polubarov, I. Kiselev, and V. Kurenkov</span>
</span>
