</table>
<p id="A4.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="A4.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{x}\doteq\max_{s\in\mathcal{S}}\|x(s)\|_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>≐</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{x}\doteq\max_{s\in\mathcal{S}}\|x(s)\|_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.
A direct calculation then gives</span></p>
