<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},6}\doteq(1+\gamma)\max\quantity{C_v,\,C_{\tref{lem:decay},2}},\qquad C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},7}\doteq\max\quantity{C_{\tref{lemma:grad_bound},2},\,C_{\tref{lemma:grad_bound},3}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≐</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mtext><a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ E.1 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Proofs of Section ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a></mtext><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≐</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mtext><a href="#Thmlemma10" title="Lemma 10. ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Proofs of Section ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a></mtext><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mtext><a href="#Thmlemma10" title="Lemma 10. ‣ E.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix E Proofs of Section ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a></mtext><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},6}\doteq(1+\gamma)\max\quantity{C_v,\,C_{\tref{lem:decay},2}},\qquad C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},7}\doteq\max\quantity{C_{\tref{lemma:grad_bound},2},\,C_{\tref{lemma:grad_bound},3}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS4.p4.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS4.p4.3.1" class="ltx_text">on <math id="A5.SS4.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\eta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\eta}</annotation></semantics></math>, by Hölder’s inequality, with <math id="A5.SS4.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},8}\doteq D_{\theta}\,C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},6}\,C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},7}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≐</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},8}\doteq D_{\theta}\,C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},6}\,C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},7}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A5.E97" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E97.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\norm{X_L}_{1}\leq C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},8}\quantity[
(1-C_{\ref{ass:diagonal-margin}})^L
+
\sqrt{\frac{\log(C_{\text{Thm}\tref{thm:emergence},5}/\eta)}{n}}
]\quantity[
1+
\sqrt{\frac{\log(C_{\text{Thm}\tref{thm:emergence},5}/\eta)}{n}}
]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"><a href="#S5.Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 5.1. ‣ 5 Inference-Time Convergence ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.1</span></a></mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>L</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mtext>Thm</mtext><mtext><a href="#Thmtheorem3" title="Theorem 3. ‣ 6 Emergence of Softmax ICTD under Reinforcement Pretraining ‣ Beyond Linear Attention: Softmax Transformers Implement In-Context Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\norm{X_L}_{1}\leq C_{\text{Thm}\text{\ref{thm:emergence}},8}\quantity[
(1-C_{\ref{ass:diagonal-margin}})^L
+
